Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:09.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}才有机会继续追赶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:17.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's a beauty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这一拍真漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:30.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wow, what a game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇 这一局！
