Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:41.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He didn't,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他没能做到
