Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's great precision on serve{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这记发球的落点非常精准
